  "Chapter": "剧团电姬　第2章",
  "Title": "不会动摇的人们",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1040201001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "？？？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我曾憧憬着能够带人前往不可思议之国的爱丽丝。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1131",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "？？？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "明明仿佛伸手可及，却连指尖都无法触碰。/n在那个只能想象的世界中旅行的爱丽丝，让我彻底着迷。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "？？？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是有一天，我忽然想到。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "？？？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "爱丽丝……又在憧憬着什么呢……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "900",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "301",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那一带的剧情，不管看多少遍我都会哭……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那么温柔的利姆鲁，明明一直说“我想在这个世界也建立一座大家都能和平生活的城市”，/n呜呜……却不得不做出那种选择……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是吗？　我反而觉得很痛快诶。/n那种垃圾一样的家伙，落得那种下场不是活该嘛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "美兔还是……希望可以的话，大家最终都能和睦相处。/n他对猪头族的安排，让我开心得都哭了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "蕾",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，缪兰的所作所为也可以这么说。/n除了利姆鲁以外，尤姆这个人的存在同样很重要。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40403,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "404"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "维鲁德拉放在300年前也是会被讨伐的一方，/n现在却成了那么好的家伙。最重要的果然还是帅吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团成员B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈？　比帅的话，明明红丸大人才是独一档吧！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦，要打一架吗？　要不要开个剧团电姬版最强角色讨论串？/n干脆来场自由式推角演讲决斗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "化妆师",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喂喂，这话我可不能当没听见。/n白老那种老练沉稳的演技才是最强吧！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "大道具负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哥布塔！　我投哥布塔一票！/n平时又搞笑又可爱，关键时刻还特别靠谱，超帅的好吗！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "见习剧团成员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我坦白，我以前写过以三上悟为对象的梦女文。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "为什么啊！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "见习剧团成员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "疲惫社畜不是超棒的吗！？/n而且性格还是利姆鲁那种哦！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "宅宅真的好喜欢聊这种角色话题。/n干脆做条冠军腰带，上擂台决一胜负算了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你在说什么啊！　就是分不出胜负才有意思！/n战斗、争执、坚持各自主张，到最后加深彼此理解，再用紧紧握手来升华！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 40103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 40503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "周末办这次留宿会，果然是正确选择。/n感觉和大家又更亲近了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "蕾",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "获得共同语言以后，先前展开的警戒之墙如今也变薄了。/n我能感受到，与这些新的电子少女之间，羁绊已经加深。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40403,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "404"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嘛——，都打着合宿的名义搞《关于我转生变成史莱姆这档事》全集马拉松了，/n就算不想，距离也会被强行拉近啦。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010220",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "以前还没完整看过，结果真的超级神！/n虽然也是因为和大家一起看，但明明有50集，体感却一眨眼就结束了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且在排练场过夜也爽上天。/n直播素材也捞了一大堆。搞得我都手痒想剪视频了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010240",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
