      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那大家在《转生史莱姆》里最喜欢谁？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯——，我果然还是利姆鲁吧。/n虽然也吃了不少苦，但感觉人生过得很开心，这点很好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040201028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040201,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "要说开心，那当然是米莉姆吧。/n那种任性劲儿和强者派头，演起来肯定很爽。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402010270",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
